      "displayDate": "Jan 19, 1977 • 8:15 AM",
      "content": "Where was I Sunday morning? Out in that zero weather on the trap range with the clay birds doing the boogie on the wind and a frozen gun barrel in my hands. I wasn't alone, but after firing at the first five I began to wonder if maybe my deck wasn't short of trump.",
